307
00:22:23.740 --> 00:22:26.940
Kuidas ma saan kurta?
Ma pean seda nautima.

308
00:22:27.040 --> 00:22:32.580
See on minu arvates parim asi,
mida keegi teha saab,

309
00:22:33.580 --> 00:22:37.259
