321
00:23:25.940 --> 00:23:28.619
Tal on ka kaksikvend.

322
00:23:31.570 --> 00:23:33.050
Mul on vend.

323
00:23:33.150 --> 00:23:35.425
Jumal küll!

324
00:23:38.369 --> 00:23:41.970
Nii Arnold kui
ka D 'abito otsustasid filmi eesmise

325
00:23:41.970 --> 00:23:43.330
makse.

326
00:23:43.430 --> 00:23:45.450
Selle asemel,
eelistades võtta protsenti

327
00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:49.830
